  "type": "deity",
  "typeConfidence": "high",
  "description": "传说中楚国君主的祖先，名重黎，是颛顼(zhuānxū)的后代，帝喾(kù)时任掌管火的官，后人尊他为火神",
  "mentions": [
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 6,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-06-19",
      "type": "annotation",
      "annotationExplanation": "传说中楚国君主的祖先，名重黎，是颛顼(zhuānxū)的后代，帝喾(kù)时任掌管火的官，后人尊他为火神"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 6,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-06-19",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "南方祝融，兽身人面，乘两龙。"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 18,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-18-22",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "炎居生节并，节并生戏器，戏器生祝融。祝融降处于江水，生共工。共工"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 18,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-18-23",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "息壤。以堙洪水，不待帝命。帝令祝融杀鲧于羽郊。鲧复生禹。帝乃命禹"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "chuci",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "entryId": "chuci-05-02",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "荒忽兮,\n\n沛罔象而自浮。\n\n祝融戒而还衡兮,\n\n腾告鸾鸟迎宓妃"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "chuci",
      "chapterIndex": 12,
      "entryId": "chuci-12-04",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "缤纷,\n\n高太息兮自怜。\n\n使祝融兮先行,\n\n令昭明兮开门。\n\n"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 6,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-06-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "之国，南至委火炎风之野，赤帝、祝融之所司者，万二千里。其令曰：爵"
    }
  ],
  "firstSeen": {
    "bookId": "shanhaijing",
    "chapterIndex": 6
  }
}
